usage: return_rest_cam6dof.py [-h]
                              [--arms {arm_1,arm_2,arm_3,arm_4} [{arm_1,arm_2,arm_3,arm_4} ...]]
                              [--seconds SECONDS] [--move] --out-json OUT_JSON

CAM-6DOF: one screened, slow straight return; --move needs step approval.
Reuse return_rest's cosine trajectory and all retract collision screens. Add
the campaign's 97% torque margin and cancel measured torque >14 N.m. No
automatic retry, alternate segment, rail motion, or MoveIt fallback.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --arms {arm_1,arm_2,arm_3,arm_4} [{arm_1,arm_2,arm_3,arm_4} ...]
  --seconds SECONDS
  --move
  --out-json OUT_JSON
